WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.540
The One Piece Manga just revealed something
that will change the course of story like

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:11.210
nothing has, probably since Ace’s battle
with Blackbeard that lead to the war at marineford.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:16.090
And that’s because Eiichiro Oda has just
kicked off a battle between Trafalgar D. Water

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.180
Law and, yup you guessed it, Blackbeard.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.180
Again.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:25.780
A development i think no one had on their
radar, especially since we just saw Marshal

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:32.161
D. Teach being chased off Amazon Lily by Rayleigh
and Boa Hancock, kidnapping Luffy’s marine

00:00:32.161 --> 00:00:34.780
friend Koby as a little souvenir in the process.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.100
And now he has ambushed Law, another one of
Luffy’s friends, who was on his way to the

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.399
next island after leaving Wano.

00:00:41.399 --> 00:00:46.850
Blackbeard has been obsessed with with getting
his hands on as many devil fruits and poneglyphs

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.649
as possible in a very short time.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.840
We know this, because while he and Law are
preparing to clash, it seems that Aokiji,

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:59.239
who has teamed up with Blackbeard for yet
unexplained reasons has invaded Big Mom’s

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:05.320
territory and has not only taken her Poneglyph,
but also kidnapped Pudding, one of the selected

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:12.100
few people who can actually decipher the Road
Poneglyphs and lead Blackbeard to Laugh Tale

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.659
before Luffy.

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:18.630
And now, should he successfully defeat Law,
Teach has to chance to not only add Kaido’s

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:24.790
poneglyph on top, but also get his hands on
Law’s legendary devil fruit powers, that

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:31.429
include the eternal youth surgery that Doflamingo
wanted above anything else.

00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:34.109
Has Aokiji truly become Luffy’s enemy?

00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:38.110
Is there any chance that Law could win this
fight?

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.030
And what would it mean for Luffy and story
if he loses?

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:55.740
Turns out, we might already know the answer
to all 

00:01:55.740 --> 00:02:47.950
of these.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:52.710
To understand why this chapter and Law’s
battle with Blackbeard is such a big deal,

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:58.810
we have to take a closer look at Blackbeard’s
actions in the story so far.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:03.600
Because even though the story tries really
hard to sell Teach as a impulsive and dangerous

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:09.880
idiot, the truth as you well know, is that
Blackbeard is one of the most cunning characters

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:16.170
in the story, that has carefully and patiently
planned to get where he is today.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:21.980
Luffy’s biggest rival for the title of Pirate
King and right nowI would say the top contender

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.410
for reaching Laugh Tale first.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:29.940
As you’ll remember, Teach, who seems to
be connected to and inspired by the legendary

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:35.650
and infamous pirate Rocks D. Xebec, joined
Whitebeard’s crew in the hope to get his

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:40.240
hands on the Yami Yami no mi, according to
him the strongest devil fruit in existence,

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.290
that seems to have been the core piece in
his plan to rise to the top of the pirate

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.290
world.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:50.970
Once he got lucky and had the fruit in his
reach, instead of stealing the fruit, he chose

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:55.090
to murder his crew mate, well knowing that
Ace would come after him.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:04:00.030
His goal from the start, as we now know was
to get his hands on Whitebeard’s Earthquake

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:04.350
powers as well, which is why he joined his
crew in the first place.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:10.320
His plan was to start a war between the Marines
and Whitebeard, well knowing that he doesn’t

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.930
have a chance against Whitebeard, yet.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:16.650
Despite his betrayal, he still fears and respects
the man.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:22.980
So he prepares everything for his big moment,
a calculated gamble with high risk, but immense

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:23.980
reward.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:28.000
He makes sure to get on the good side of the
World Government to become a warlord and thus

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.460
gain access to the high security prison Impel
Down.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.560
He hands over Ace to the Marines, telling
them about Ace’s heritage, well knowing

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:41.150
that the government would want to turn the
execution of the pirate king’s son into

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.380
a major publicity stunt.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:49.150
And he also knows, that Whitebeard would come
to save his son, because he used to be part

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:53.780
of that very same family, that he never loved
in the first place.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:59.180
Once the war had begun, Teach used the commotion
to enter Impel Down and grabbed some of the

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:04.620
most powerful and infamous pirates locked
away on level 6 into his crew.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:09.070
Now commanding a quite formidable force, he
grows confident, that he will be able to see

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.560
his plan through all the way.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:15.150
He waits until both marines and pirates are
exhausted from the war.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:19.960
Then he sees his chance, he swoops in, and
even though he underestimated the power of

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:27.190
a dying Whitebeard, is able to steal the Gura
Gura no mi and escapes, now with 3 essential

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:32.450
pieces of his plan secure in his hands: Two
of the most powerful devil fruits in the world,

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:37.320
a crew of monsters and Whitebeard’s vacant
place among the Yonko.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:42.040
While Luffy and the straw hats train over
the time skip, Blackbeard starts the third

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.040
phase of his plan.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:50.090
He knows there are still people out there
strong enough to snuff out his ambitions.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.760
And that scares him.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.960
So he does what he does best, lay low and
wait.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.200
While all the other Yonko’s are being challenged
by the members of the worst generation, Blackbeard

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:06.100
is happy securing his position and getting
his hands on as many useful and powerful devil

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:09.480
fruits as possible to boost his crew even
more.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:15.020
We have already seen that his commanders have
eaten some truly frightening devil fruits

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.230
and 4 new ones are revealed by Oda here as
well.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:23.370
Jesus Burgess has eaten the Riki Riki no Mi
giving him abnormal strength so he’s easily

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:26.290
able to lift a mountain.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:32.800
Doc Q has the Shiku Shiku no Mi, the sick
sick fruit, which is quite ironic.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.780
He can infect people with sickness.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:38.750
Van Augur can teleport people using the warp
warp fruit.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:44.450
And Doc Q’s horse Stronger has eaten the
mythical pegasus zoan fruit, that basically

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:46.550
just gives him wings i guess.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:52.030
It looks like the devil fruit phase of Teaches
plan is now also complete.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:56.960
Which now brings him into the final stage
of his plan, that he needs to become pirate

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.960
king:

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:03.900
Getting his hands on the four road poneglyphs
and finding a way to decipher their contents.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.550
For that he has laid low and waited for the
right moment.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:11.830
He was too scared to challenge either Big
Mom or Kaido heads on, but now that they have

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:16.560
been defeated by Luffy, Kid and Law and knowing
that they would get their hands on Kaido’s

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:21.060
poneglyph, he waited in the waters around
Wano and tracked down the one out of the three

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:25.580
that arguably poses the smallest threat to
him right now.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.419
And sadly that person is law.

00:07:28.419 --> 00:07:32.660
Blackbeard attacks his submarine and forces
Law to retreat to a nearby island, where he

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:39.080
can now engage him in a one on one battle,
that he is very confident he can easily win.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:43.110
So it looks like while Luffy is learning more
about the true nature of Devil fruits from

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:48.919
Doctor Vegapunk, Law, who’s a doctor might
get the chance to learn more about Blackbeards

00:07:48.919 --> 00:07:49.960
strange body.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:54.770
But even if Teach is able to defeat Law here
and get his copy of Kaido’s poneglyph, what

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.300
about the rest?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:00.260
Well, turns out, he’s been on the move for
the rest of them all along.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:06.110
We have now gotten three covers in a row,
that strongly suggest that Aokiji is in Whole

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:12.350
Cake island, Big Mom’s territory, that after
her defeat is pretty much defenseless.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:16.229
Where we know another road poneglyph is hidden
in this room.

00:08:16.229 --> 00:08:19.540
The first cover shows two mysterious figures
appearing in town.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:25.080
The second is chocolate town, where Luffy
first met Pudding, completely frozen over.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:30.430
And now, we see Cracker, one of Big Mom’s,
commanders, frozen over.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:37.749
And it looks exactly like this, where Aokiji
froze Robin or here with Luffy.

00:08:37.749 --> 00:08:43.759
And Brulee has realized that Pudding has vanished,
Big Mom’s daughter of the three eyed tribe

00:08:43.759 --> 00:08:49.540
that allegedly can naturally decipher the
inscription on the poneglyphs.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:54.519
This of course shouts Blackbeard, not only
because it’s the very same chapter as his

00:08:54.519 --> 00:08:59.930
attempt to get Law’s poneglyph, but also
because of this panel here, where one of the

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:04.759
Gorosei reveals to us that Aokiji has teamed
up with Teach.

00:09:04.759 --> 00:09:11.110
Which feels strange, because as we know from
all these moments here, Aokiji always seemed

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.940
to be a good guy, even sympmathizing with
Luffy.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:19.500
In his youth he was a big admirer of Garp
and his sense for what’s truly just and

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.610
fair, representing a more gentle and human
side of the Marines and the government.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:29.420
He protected Robin, spared Luffy on Long ring
island AND during marineford and the last

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:35.399
time we saw him he saved his friend smoker
from being sliced into salami by Doflamingo.

00:09:35.399 --> 00:09:41.970
But it also very much looks like he’s delivering
a road poneglyph, a crucial piece of information

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.889
to get Blackbeard more power, directly to
him.

00:09:45.889 --> 00:09:47.130
What’s going on here?

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:52.170
At first glance, you really have to wonder
if Aokiji didn’t actually just legitimately

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.170
switch sides.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.300
Maybe he lost faith in the world government
so much after his battle with akainu, that

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:02.029
he decided to tear it all down, even if it
meant joining hands with Blackbeard.

00:10:02.029 --> 00:10:08.199
And it’s definitely a real possibility that
would make for some truly interesting plot

00:10:08.199 --> 00:10:09.480
down the line.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:15.629
But I don’t think it’s very likely, Oda
has portrait Aokiji as a force of good on

00:10:15.629 --> 00:10:19.959
countless occasions, many of them where he
didn’t need to show any kindness.

00:10:19.959 --> 00:10:24.540
He also doesn’t seem like the type of person
who would hold a grudge or even be out for

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:29.040
revenge against an organization that is full
with life long friends of his.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:33.940
Just look at Punk Hazard, where he went out
of his way to save Smoker from being killed.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:38.990
I don’t think that’s the type of person
who would want Blackbeard to burn all of the

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:39.990
marines to the ground.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.569
There are 3 alternatives to Kuzan now having
gone Anakin Skywalker on us.

00:10:44.569 --> 00:10:49.790
First, and in my opinion the most likely option,
is that he is still with the Marines, an undercover

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:55.810
agent for the secret marine unit sword, that
operates independently and without the knowledge

00:10:55.810 --> 00:11:00.819
of the government, which is why the Gorosei
didn’t know about it.

00:11:00.819 --> 00:11:03.250
He could also have teamed up with the revolutionaries.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:08.589
A force that wants to take down the celestial
dragons, but not the Marines themselves.

00:11:08.589 --> 00:11:13.550
Or he could be out there doing his own thing,
gathering intel on Blackbeard independently

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:20.279
and delivering it to whoever he finds worthy
in the end, which would then most likely be

00:11:20.279 --> 00:11:21.279
Luffy.

00:11:21.279 --> 00:11:26.179
But right now it doesn’t really matter whether
Kuzan is friend or enemy or spy.

00:11:26.179 --> 00:11:32.589
He is still working with Blackbeard and it
looks like he will bring him not only a second

00:11:32.589 --> 00:11:38.389
poneglyph, but someone who can translate the
ancient language on it for Teach.

00:11:38.389 --> 00:11:41.179
That would give him 2 Poneglyphs really quick.

00:11:41.179 --> 00:11:44.520
Unless law is able to actually win.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:47.649
But is that even possible?

00:11:47.649 --> 00:11:51.029
Law has now a bounty of 3 billion berries
for a reason.

00:11:51.029 --> 00:11:56.059
Why he teamed up with kid to take down Big
Mom, he is still one of the strongest pirates

00:11:56.059 --> 00:11:57.059
out there.

00:11:57.059 --> 00:12:01.559
Law not only has an incredibly versatile and
powerful devil fruit, but maybe even more

00:12:01.559 --> 00:12:06.069
importantly the brains to get the most out
of it.

00:12:06.069 --> 00:12:11.300
Blackbeard is a schemer, but so is Law, it’s
no coincidence that both of them benefited

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:15.420
from the Rocky port incident, which Law orchestrated.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.639
He can absolutely match Teach when it comes
to strategy and maneuvering.

00:12:19.639 --> 00:12:24.790
And since his devil fruit allows him teleportation,
he could get close to Blackbeard without giving

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:27.040
him the chance to nullify his powers.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:32.269
His gamma knife was one of the keys in bringing
down Big Mom and since he has awakened his

00:12:32.269 --> 00:12:35.319
fruit, it is more powerful than ever.

00:12:35.319 --> 00:12:40.569
Law also has an incredibly high level understanding
of Haki, confirming something in this chapter

00:12:40.569 --> 00:12:45.839
that we have only speculated so far: Powerful
haki allows the nullification of devil fruit

00:12:45.839 --> 00:12:46.839
powers.

00:12:46.839 --> 00:12:51.069
Which could be a real game changer against
Blackbeard.

00:12:51.069 --> 00:12:54.430
Teach on the other hand is ridiculously powerful
at this point.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:59.279
Not only did he easily defeat ace with his
darkness fruit, which power you can see on

00:12:59.279 --> 00:13:05.439
these panels here, but now wielding Whitebeard’s
Gura Gura no mi, he has maybe the strongest

00:13:05.439 --> 00:13:09.279
offensive power in the world as well.

00:13:09.279 --> 00:13:12.290
Just look at what whitebeard did to the ocean
with it.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:18.439
On top of that, Blackbeard has Doc Q with
him, while Law’s crew has yet to prove their

00:13:18.439 --> 00:13:19.439
worth.

00:13:19.439 --> 00:13:23.529
They didn’t really shine all too much during
the raid on Onigashima.

00:13:23.529 --> 00:13:28.519
I think that even though Law would at least
have a decent chance against most people in

00:13:28.519 --> 00:13:32.779
the world, I just don’t see him taking down
Blackbeard.

00:13:32.779 --> 00:13:37.920
Teach has been built up throughout the story
to be luffy’s main rival for the one piece.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:42.860
He is bound to be one of the, if not THE main
villain of the story. he just kidnapped Koby

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.470
and was responsible for ace’s capture and
death.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:51.319
Don’t you think it would be a bit anticlimactic
if he could be stopped by Law?

00:13:51.319 --> 00:13:53.509
No offense to Law fans.

00:13:53.509 --> 00:13:59.860
Law beating Teach makes absolutely no sense,
neither power wise nor plot wise.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:06.379
I only see 2 options for law to not get captured
or killed by blackbeard here and hand over

00:14:06.379 --> 00:14:12.629
his poneglyph plus possibly his devil fruit:
I think law is capable enough to try and get

00:14:12.629 --> 00:14:17.350
away from the fight and maybe warn Luffy and
co about his powers.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:23.569
Or, and this would be very dark, but it’s
possible, he could sacrifice himself and remotely

00:14:23.569 --> 00:14:28.480
perform the immortality surgery on Luffy to
not have to perform it on Blackbeard.

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:33.980
We don’t actually know what the conditions
for this ultimate ability are, so it’s definitely

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.199
an option.

00:14:35.199 --> 00:14:41.670
Because if Law actually ends up losing this
fight, it would truly change the projective

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.629
of the entire story.

00:14:43.629 --> 00:14:44.629
Here’s why.

00:14:44.629 --> 00:14:50.100
Again Law has a road poneglyph, he has one
of the most valuable fruits with the ability

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:54.149
to make someone immortal, but there is also
this (Beppo).

00:14:54.149 --> 00:14:56.869
And you know where the third road poneglyph
is right now?

00:14:56.869 --> 00:14:57.869
Exactly.

00:14:57.869 --> 00:14:58.869
here.

00:14:58.869 --> 00:15:02.929
If blackbeard captures Law, he will have 2
poneglpyhs and a mink, that could lead him

00:15:02.929 --> 00:15:07.430
to the 3rd one hidden in the whale tree on
Zou, the home of the minks.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:11.699
Not only will that put Blackbeard on Luffy’s
level, with 3 red stones and someone to decipher

00:15:11.699 --> 00:15:17.209
them, but he would have 2 of luffy’s best
friends as hostages.

00:15:17.209 --> 00:15:22.449
Luffy was so traumatize by losing ace, he
would not hesitate a second to come for them

00:15:22.449 --> 00:15:26.660
if he finds out that Blackbeard might kill
two other people who are close to him.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:31.759
And Teach is smart enough to draw people he
wants something from out with their loved

00:15:31.759 --> 00:15:32.759
ones.

00:15:32.759 --> 00:15:34.810
We already saw that with Whitebeard and Ace.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:40.239
SO he might wait for Luffy to get his hands
on the 4th poneglyph and then bait him with

00:15:40.239 --> 00:15:42.769
law and koby to take it from him.

00:15:42.769 --> 00:15:48.241
and then, with the road to laugh tale, a crew
of monsters and 2 or maybe even 3 powerful

00:15:48.241 --> 00:15:54.259
devil fruits, what is going to stop Teach
from becoming Pirate king before luffy?

00:15:54.259 --> 00:15:57.880
Where will he get a third fruit and how is
he able to eat more than one devil friuit

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.070
in the first place?

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:05.569
We don’t know yet, but I have a pretty interesting
theory that you can watch here next.

